<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5678" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">brĕvĭcŭlus</span></b> ,
			a, um, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>adj. dim.</i> [brevis], <i>somewhat
				short</i> or <i>small</i> (rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">homo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Merc. 3, 4, 54</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pinnae, Fronto, Eloq.: grabatulus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 1, p. 107, 18</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: 
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">brĕvĭcŭlus</span></b> ,
			i, m. (sc. liber), <i>a short
				writing</i>, <i>a summary</i>, <i><span class="en">Cod.
					Just. 1, 7</span></i>, tit. 44, and Cod. Th. 1, 4, tit.
			17 dub.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, of time: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tempus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 6, p. 183, 35</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
